  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups whole almonds",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "3 tablespoons honey",
    "3 tablespoons water",
    "1 tablespoon almond oil"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GU96bB1lFV4NPGEUjwzjxpOl39Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229881-honey-roasted-almonds-DDMFS-step-1-BG-2980-63a12340afdc47cd887b2b9eeb213492.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229881/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread almonds in a single layer on a baking sheet and place in a cold oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cCpmpmzSd5wSLpZ24ot8V4LVGYY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229881-honey-roasted-almonds-DDMFS-step-2-BG-2982-4edc8cff53ea45e0a3fb512ccedc056d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229881/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the oven on to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Bake almonds, stirring occasionally, until light tan and fragrant, 12 to 15 minutes. The nuts will continue to cook after removing them from the oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, mix sugar and salt together in a small bowl; sprinkle 1 tablespoon sugar mixture into a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nUwi2keZXZEkSoDNqZ4F-V2U9oc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229881-honey-roasted-almonds-DDMFS-step-3-BG-2986-1dd9ab2a45ac4583a5c7e902ffce0f7f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229881/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir honey, water, and almond oil together in a saucepan; bring to a boil. Add almonds; cook and stir until almonds have absorbed all the liquid, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UK-svc0H3TZY6E5_wV3_k9IBmI0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229881-honey-roasted-almonds-DDMFS-step-5-BG-3004-f16581aea5c344f8841da01cc2a505ef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229881/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer coated almonds to the large bowl sprinkled with sugar mixture. Sprinkle remaining sugar mixture over almonds; toss to coat evenly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ke_1tDb3tiygerkUfJSH4r_fwBY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229881-honey-roasted-almonds-DDMFS-step-6-BG-3007-e5628f3cd5104dbdbab4e61e081c3d10.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229881/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread almonds onto waxed paper to cool completely. Store at room temperature in a tightly covered container or resealable plastic bag.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ydl5IDz9VesVxumXkTMqnUeBgx0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229881-honey-roasted-almonds-DDMFS-step-7-BG-3009-5b4dfb89a31d4b92ac9f12d9568c4612.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229881/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
